DATA NOTICE (catalog.json, games/, metadata/, checksums/)

The data files are historical lottery results: factual records derived from
publicly available results of the lottery operators named in each game's
source.json. The maintainers make no claim of ownership over those facts, and
the MIT grant above is not a statement about the legal status of the
underlying results. The data is provided "AS IS", without warranty of accuracy
or completeness, for statistical research. It is not an official publication
of any operator; this project is not affiliated with any lottery operator. The
initial Vietlott records were imported from a third-party dataset whose notice
is reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. See PROVENANCE.md for the full
acquisition, transformation and validation record.
